DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/connectivity/directory/services/{service_id}
Removes a single Workers VPC connectivity service by its ID. Any Worker bindings referencing this service will stop working.
Required: account_id (path); service_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/connectivity/directory/services/{service_id}
Fetches a single Workers VPC connectivity service by its ID.
Required: account_id (path); service_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/connectivity/directory/services/{service_id}
Updates an existing Workers VPC connectivity service by its ID.
Required: account_id (path); service_id (path); body (body)
